<title>USA: Greenspan completes speech, no comment on economy.</title>
<headline>Greenspan completes speech, no comment on economy.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal Reserve chairman Alan Greenspan completed a speech to the Independent Bankers Association of America meeting here on Saturday.</p>
<p>The U.S. central banker made no comments about the economy or the upcoming meeting of the Federal Open Market Committee.</p>
<p>--Aaron Pressman((202-898-8312))</p>
</text>
